menu "Provisioning portal"

config PROVISION_AUTO_S
    int "Start the portal after this long with no known network (s)"
    default 90
    range 0 3600
    help
        A station moved to a site whose SSID is not in its table would
        otherwise sit red forever. 0 disables the automatic trigger; the
        BOOT button and the console still work.

config PROVISION_TIMEOUT_S
    int "Close after this long with nobody on the portal (s)"
    default 1800

config PROVISION_IDLE_S
    int "Close when a connected client has been idle this long (s)"
    default 300
    help
        Association alone does not keep the portal open: a phone that
        joined the open network and was put down would otherwise hold the
        station off the fleet network. Only page requests count.

config PROVISION_MAX_S
    int "Hard cap on a portal session (s)"
    default 3600

endmenu
